%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: LoadingScreenNORMAL
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: But that doesn't make sense.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: There's been too many moments where things have gone off script, even
      without our intervention.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Maybe the game, if we <i>are</i> literally in one, has been modded?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: But it would be weird if it was modded to account for the specific actions
      we took...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Maybe this is the void, the domain of Sithis?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: If so, is there something that the Elder Scroll needs to show me here?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I look around, seeing if there's, well, anything.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Nope! Still nothing.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hello?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Helloooo?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: It doesn't seem like there's anyone here-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: '!!!'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751936
    - rid: 268099842819751937
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: This guy's got a school uniform?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, uh, you wouldn't happen to go to Sakura High by any chance?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 884ec19fdaeec3c41a2119aa333adb2e, type: 2}
    dialog: I, uh, yeah...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 884ec19fdaeec3c41a2119aa333adb2e, type: 2}
    dialog: How did you know?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751938
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: By the uniform, I go there too.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751939
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 884ec19fdaeec3c41a2119aa333adb2e, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh yeah? What year are you in?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751940
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm a senior. What about you?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751942
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 884ec19fdaeec3c41a2119aa333adb2e, type: 2}
    dialog: ... A senior?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751941
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 884ec19fdaeec3c41a2119aa333adb2e, type: 2}
    dialog: As in a third year?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Third year? Where have I heard that before...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751943
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 884ec19fdaeec3c41a2119aa333adb2e, type: 2}
    dialog: If it's your last year, that'd explain why we haven't met, I'm still
      in my second year.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751944
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I guess so, yeah.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you... know where we are?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 884ec19fdaeec3c41a2119aa333adb2e, type: 2}
    dialog: I dunno. I've only just got here.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751945
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 884ec19fdaeec3c41a2119aa333adb2e, type: 2}
    dialog: I think...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751947
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You... think?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751948
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 884ec19fdaeec3c41a2119aa333adb2e, type: 2}
    dialog: It's not like I have a watch.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751949
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That's fair, I guess.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751950
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So, what's your name, anyway?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: My name's {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751951
    - rid: 268099842819751952
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, that's my name, too!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751953
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I didn't think my name was <i>that</i> common...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: What're the odds?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751954
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: You uh... into cosplay?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751955
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... what???
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751956
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: I just thought that, since you're wearing <i>that</i>, you know...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751957
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I'm wearing <i>that</i>?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751959
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Oh. The armor.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: No, uh, this stuff's the real deal. Not a costume.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: Right...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: You wanna play cards or something?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751960
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You have a deck of cards?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751961
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: ... no.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751962
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Great.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751963
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Were you, uh, doing anything particular before you got here?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: Nope.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751964
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: 'I was just walking to school when I heard an annoying voice yelling:
      "heeey," at me- '
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: 'And then bam! I''m here. '
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: Wherever here is...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751965
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: That's... significantly more unprompted than being sent here by an Elder
      Scroll.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Maybe he was sent here by the same thing that sent the rest of us to
      Skyrim?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: What's taking {mc} so long?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751966
    - rid: 268099842819751967
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Don't tell me the cutscene is bugged or something-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: Did you hear that?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: ...!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh crap, you're not supposed to be here-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hello? Who's that talking-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751968
    - rid: 268099842819751969
    - rid: 268099842819751970
    - rid: 268099842819751971
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: C'mon, {mc}, Alduin's here! Do something!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751972
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, wha-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751974
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Sure enough, as I look up in the sky I spot Alduin and Paarthurnax going
      at it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, okay, let me just...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>j8r z4 frul</font>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796455
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I successfully nail Alduin with Dragonrend.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Shortly thereafter, he falls out of the sky.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751975
    - rid: 268099842819751976
    - rid: 268099842819751977
    - rid: 268099842819751978
    - rid: 268099842819751979
    - rid: 4972360475574796456
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright Monika, we've a dragon to slay!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751981
    - rid: 268099842819751982
    - rid: 268099842819751983
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c9971f7409084c140a7ff61c782e0c80, type: 2}
    dialog: Meyz mul, Dovahkiin. You have become strong.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819751984
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c9971f7409084c140a7ff61c782e0c80, type: 2}
    dialog: But I am <i>Al-du-in</i>, Firstborn of Akatosh! I cannot be slain here,
      by you or anyone else!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c9971f7409084c140a7ff61c782e0c80, type: 2}
    dialog: You cannot prevail against me, I will outlast you... mortal!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Alduin flies off, I'm guessing to Skuldafn so he can go feast on the
      souls in Sovngarde.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819752064
    - rid: 268099842819752065
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... Monika?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah? What's up, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819752075
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You know a lot of our fellow students right?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, I guess?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Have you ever heard of a guy that had the same name as me?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099911722205193
    - rid: 268099911722205196
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Dunno what's so startling about that...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Pretty scrawny, yellow eyes, short dark-brown hair, underclassman; any
      of those ringing a bell?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Because the Elder Scroll showed me that guy for... some reason.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Did... did he really find the original {mc}?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I think I remember him being pretty scrawny, although my memories pretty
      hazy; I can't remember his face at all.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099911722205194
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Did, uh, that other {mc} say anything... weird?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099911722205195
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Other than the story of his weird arrival to the void place I found him
      in? Not really.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099911722205197
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Although, there was this other voice that came in toward the end of our
      conversation and said something about someone not supposed to be there.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Not sure if it meant me or him.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Was that <b>you</b>?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Nope.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (That <i>entity</i>, then?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: I think so!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Figures. It was the thing that replaced {mc}, so I guess that it makes
      sense <i>it</i> would be involved.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099911722205198
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: 'To answer your question: yeah, I knew <i>of</i> another {mc} who was
      a few grades below us.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099911722205199
    - rid: 268099911722205202
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I didn't really know him that well, just that he was a student who attends
      our school too.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: He seemed to be a pretty reserved guy from the few times I saw him when
      I was running errands for some teachers.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099911722205200
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I suppose it's something that we should keep in mind; that we've seen
      another person from school that wasn't part of the club.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099911722205201
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Enough of that for now, we're heading back to Whiterun.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099911722205203
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... why?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Because there's something in Whiterun that'll help me chase down Alduin,
      once and for all.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright then, {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099911722205204
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
